  	re8[ do re] fa[ sol fa] la[ sol la] fa[ la sol] la[ do la] la4 r8 \coupure
	si8[ do la] la[ sol la] do[ re la]~la[ fa] mi[ re] do[ re] re4 r8 \coupure
	sol8[ fa re] fa[ sol fa] mi[ re fa] re[ la' sol] fa[ sol la] la4 r8 \coupure
	sol8[ la] la[ do] si[ do] do[ re la] fa[ re[ mi] fa[ sol re] re4 r8 \coupure
	mi8[ re] re[ do] re[ do] mi[ re]~re[ la'[~la] sol[ la] sol[ la] la4 r8 \coupure
	do,8[ re] fa[ sol] fa[ mi] do[ re] re re[ fa sol] fa[ mi re] re4 r8 \coupure
	sol8[ fa] la[ sol] la[ si] do[ la] fa la[ la sol] la[ do re] la4 r8 \coupure
	re8[ do]~do[ si la] sol[ la] la[ fa] fa[ sol fa] fa[ la sol] la4 r8 \coupure
	sol8[ la] la[ si] do[ re la] fa[ fa] re[ do] re[ fa] fa[ mi] re4 r8 \coupure
